  "description": "Ha Si-Yeon, 30, who retired from being a popular idol and is now an actress, suddenly has a crush on Han Eun-Gyeol, a small business male idol. She, who was always used to being loved, now has a crush! Will she be able to keep her true identity a secret idol fan until the end? A heart-pounding secret idol fan romance!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
